) and G2192 (ἔχω);","strongs_def":" to hold down (fast), in various applications (literally or figuratively)","kjv_def":"have, hold (fast), keep (in memory), let, X make toward, possess, retain, seize on, stay, take, withhold","n":19,"o":"MAT21:38 LUK4:42 LUK8:15 LUK14:9 JHN5:4 ACT27:40 ROM1:18 ROM7:6 1CO7:30 1CO11:2 1CO15:2 2CO6:10 1TH5:21 2TH2:6 2TH2:7 PHM1:13 HEB3:6 HEB3:14 HEB10:23"},"G2749":{"lemma":"κεῖμαι","translit":"keîmai","derivation":"middle voice of a primary verb;","strongs_def":" to lie outstretched (literally or figuratively)","kjv_def":"be (appointed, laid up, made, set), lay, lie","n":26,"o":"MAT3:10 MAT5:14 MAT28:6 LUK2:12 LUK2:16 LUK2:34 LUK3:9 LUK12:19 LUK23:53 LUK24:12 JHN2:6 JHN11:41 JHN19:29 JHN20:5 JHN20:6 JHN20:7 JHN20:12 JHN21:9 1CO3:11 2CO3:15 PHP1:17 1TH3:3 1TI1:9 1JN5:19 REV4:2 REV21:16"},"G2790":{"lemma":"κιθαρῳδός","translit":"kitharōidós","derivation":"from G2788 (κιθάρα) and a derivative of the same as G5603 (ᾠδή);","strongs_def":" a lyre-singer(-player), i.e. harpist","kjv_def":"harper","n":2,"o":"REV14:2 REV18:22"},"G2772":{"lemma":"κέρμα","translit":"kérma","derivation":"from G2751 (κείρω);","strongs_def":" a clipping (bit), i.e. (specially) a coin","kjv_def":"money","n":1,"o":"JHN2:15"},"G2737":{"lemma":"κατώτερος","translit":"katṓteros","derivation":"comparative from G2736 (κάτω);","strongs_def":" inferior (locally, of Hades)","kjv_def":"lower","n":1,"o":"EPH4:9"},"G2799":{"lemma":"κλαίω","translit":"klaíō","derivation":"of uncertain affinity;","strongs_def":" to sob, i.e. wail aloud (whereas 1145 is rather to cry silently)","kjv_def":"bewail, weep","n":34,"o":"MAT2:18 MAT26:75 MRK5:38 MRK5:39 MRK14:72 MRK16:10 LUK6:21 LUK6:25 LUK7:13 LUK7:32 LUK7:38 LUK8:52 LUK19:41 LUK22:62 LUK23:28 JHN11:31 JHN11:33 JHN16:20 JHN20:11 JHN20:13 JHN20:15 ACT9:39 ACT21:13 ROM12:15 1CO7:30 PHP3:18 JAS4:9 JAS5:1 REV5:4 REV5:5 REV18:9 REV18:11 REV18:15 REV18:19"},"G2796":{"lemma":"κίνησις","translit":"kínēsis","derivation":"from G2795 (κινέω);","st